<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: As for the difficulties we've encountered in our research ... -->
  <WNA_Research_Dialog>关于我们在研究上遇到的困难……</WNA_Research_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: "We know that hard situation you are experiencing." the Archonpriest seems already knows what we want to ask. \n\n"Our assist won't be free. 2357 silver, and your faith, that's enough." -->
  <WNA_OptionDesc_Dialog>“我们理解你们正面临的困难。”这位主司教士似乎已经知道了我们想问什么。\n\n“我们的帮助不是免费的。2357白银，以及你们的信仰，这就够了。”</WNA_OptionDesc_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: We're willing to learn. -->
  <WNA_Option_Dialog>我们愿意学习。</WNA_Option_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: "May you follow the right path."\n\n<color=#FF0000>WARNING: some price will be paid.</color>\n\n<color=#FFFF00>This will cost you 2357 silver, but your faction ideo will be converted to Whelingnorther Alliance. If you are concerned about your faction ideology, please THINK CAREFULLY before you continue. \n\nSurely you can choose an alternate option, this way WNA won't take your ideo, but they will re-consider their relation with us.</color> -->
  <WNA_FinalWarning_Dialog>“愿你们遵行正道。”\n\n&lt;color=#FF0000&gt;警告：某些代价将被付出。&lt;/color&gt;\n\n&lt;color=#FFFF00&gt;这一行动将花费2357白银，同时殖民地的文化将被威灵诺德联合会同化。如果您对殖民地的文化比较在意，务必三思而后行。\n\n当然您也可以选择另一个选项，派系的文化将被保留，但威灵会将重新考虑与我们的关系：我们与威灵会之间的关系将回归中立。&lt;/color&gt;</WNA_FinalWarning_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: We've seen the risks, and willing to pay the price. -->
  <WNA_OptionWellKnown_Dialog>我已知晓风险，愿意付出代价。</WNA_OptionWellKnown_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: I think out ideology is more important ... -->
  <WNA_AltOption_Dialog>我还是觉得我们的文化更重要一点……</WNA_AltOption_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: We can pay everything we have! <color=#FF0000>(We will lost everything in our stock zone.)</color> -->
  <WNA_ThirdOption_Dialog>我们可以付出我们的所有财产！&lt;color=#FF0000&gt;（我们将付出储存区内的所有物品）&lt;/color&gt;</WNA_ThirdOption_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: Sorry. (give up and exit) -->
  <WNA_GoBack_Dialog>抱歉。（放弃离开）</WNA_GoBack_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: Insufficient silver. (2357 required) -->
  <WNA_NoSilver_Dialog>余额不足。（需要2357白银）</WNA_NoSilver_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: The price is paid -->
  <WNA_OptionDone_Dialog>代价已付出</WNA_OptionDone_Dialog>
  <!-- EN: We have paid the appropriate price, and Whelingnorther Alliance has provided the appropriate reward. We have completed the research we needed. -->
  <WNA_OptionDoneDesc_Dialog>我们付出了合适的代价，威灵会也履行了他们的诺言。我们完成了这项研究。</WNA_OptionDoneDesc_Dialog>
</LanguageData>